    {
      "beat": "Setup: the experiment",
      "narration": "Can gut microbes shape body fat? Germ-free C57BL/6J mice were colonised at 6 weeks with microbiota from lean or obese donors, 20 per group, and fat mass was measured at 8 weeks.",
